  "description": "## Apex Protocol\n\n**Efficiency is our standard.**\n\nWe are a goal-oriented guild focused on maximizing progress through consistent, active play.\n\n- **Participation:** Mandatory contribution to Guild Challenges.\n- **Stockpile:** All deposits count toward contributions and support Guild Hall development.\n- **Discord:** https://discord.gg/UnMzezMR5x (Optional)\n- **Have Fun!** ❤️\n\n---\n\n## ⚡ Current Guild Hall Goal\n\n**Energizing Pool Restoration**\n- **Overall Progress:** 92%\n\n**Resources Collected:**\n- ✅ Spruce Log: 12,500 / 12,500 (100%)\n- ✅ Maple Log: 12,500 / 12,500 (100%)\n- 🪵 Mystical Log: 5,549 / 7,500 (74%)\n- ✅ Iron Bar: 7,500 / 7,500 (100%)\n- ✅ Mercury Bar: 7,500 / 7,500 (100%)\n- ✅ Uranium Bar: 7,500 / 7,500 (100%)\n\n---\n\n## ⚔️ Raid Schedule\n\n- **When:** Weekdays at 1:00 PM EDT\n- **Location:** Floating Garden\n- **Participation:** +10 contribution points per raid\n\n---\n\n## 📋 Guild Contribution Rules\n\n- **Monthly Goal:** 400 contribution points\n- **Guild Challenges and Stockpile Deposits:** Count toward monthly goal\n- **Guild Raids:** +10 points per raid\n- Requirements may increase as the guild grows.\n\n**🚨 Warning System**\n- **Month 1:** 🟨 Yellow Card (First Warning)\n- **Month 2:** 🟥 Red Card (Final Warning)\n- **Month 3:** ❌ Removal from Guild\n\n**Important:**\n- Removal occurs after 3 consecutive months of missed goals.\n- Meeting the monthly goal resets all warnings.\n- Planning to be away? DM Mega or Mimichu.\n\n---\n\n**🟨 Yellow Card**\n\n*No members currently listed.*\n\n**🟥 Red Card**\n\n*No members currently listed.*\n\n---\n\n## 🏆 Guild Achievements\n\n- ✅ Guild Hall\n- ✅ Mission Table\n- ✅ Unity Seal\n- ✅ Raid Planner\n- ✅ Energizing Pool",
